# Upstream merge commit for each patch in the series.
#
# The release gate's phase 0 uses this to answer "has upstream absorbed this
# patch yet" mechanically:  git merge-base --is-ancestor <commit> <tag>
#
# Keep in sync with the "Upstream status" row of each note under notes/.
#
# Format: <patch-filename> <upstream-merge-commit>
#
